        <mxCell id="enums" value="&lt;b&gt;Enums&lt;/b&gt; &amp;#8212; StrEnum, values shared verbatim with the crawler query builder and the frontend drop-downs&lt;hr size='1'/&gt;&lt;b&gt;EmployerType&lt;/b&gt; &amp;nbsp; university &amp;#183; research_institute &amp;#183; industry &amp;#183; philanthropic&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;CareerStage&lt;/b&gt; &amp;nbsp; undergraduate &amp;#183; graduate_student &amp;#183; postdoc_0_2 &amp;#183; postdoc_2_5 &amp;#183; postdoc_5_10 &amp;#183; postdoc_10_plus&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;FundingType&lt;/b&gt; &amp;nbsp; salary &amp;#183; consumables &amp;#183; equipment &amp;#183; all &amp;#183; any&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;EligibilityState&lt;/b&gt; &amp;nbsp; eligible &amp;#183; potentially_eligible &amp;#183; unknown &amp;#183; likely_ineligible &amp;nbsp; &lt;i&gt;(four states, never yes/no)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;MatchLevel&lt;/b&gt; &amp;nbsp; high &amp;#183; medium &amp;#183; low&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;DeadlineBand&lt;/b&gt; &amp;nbsp; over_60_days &amp;#183; days_60_to_30 &amp;#183; days_30_to_15 &amp;#183; under_15_days &amp;#183; closed &amp;#183; unknown&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;FundingBand&lt;/b&gt; &amp;nbsp; under_1m &amp;#183; from_1m_to_2m &amp;#183; from_2m_to_5m &amp;#183; over_5m &amp;#183; unknown&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;OpportunityStatus&lt;/b&gt; &amp;nbsp; active &amp;#183; closed &amp;nbsp; &lt;i&gt;(closed is a soft delete, filtered at read time)&lt;/i&gt;" style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingRight=14;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2937;strokeWidth=1.2;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#D9A91A;" vertex="1" parent="1">
